    "longDescription": "Meet the online learning platform that prepares you for every career moment. Register for free to discover:\n\n- Options for every budget, from free courses to professional certificates to full degrees.\n- World-class content partners like MIT, Harvard, Amazon, and Google.\n- Upskilling opportunities in critical disciplines like AI, supply chain, and sustainability.\n\nIt’s never too late or too early to join edX. Our courses and programs meet you where you are in your professional trajectory. You can:\n\n- Switch industries. Launch, change, or advance your tech career with immersive boot camps.\n- Strengthen your résumé. Deepen your expertise and showcase your skills with professional certificate programs.\n- Level up as a leader. Learn to lead initiatives and teams with executive education programs. \n- Earn a degree. Unlock new career opportunities with master’s, doctorate, and undergraduate degree programs.\n\nMake your next career move on your schedule. With edX’s free mobile app, you can:\n\n- Stream online courses in AI, cybersecurity, data science, and more.\n- Download course materials and transcripts for uninterrupted access.\n- Test your knowledge with quizzes, assignments, and exams.\n- Discover and enroll in new courses and programs as your skills evolve.\n\nReady to get started? So are we. Download the app and register for free in minutes.\n\nVisit: edx.org\nLike: facebook.com/edx\nFollow: x.com/edxonline and instagram.com/edxonline",
